%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51fb4c6070f247e48b4377b5728b8182, type: 3}
  m_Name: H12_2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: I did it! I shifted again.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I open my eyes and immediately turn to check up on Mr. Horse, his hand
      still in mine.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 8
      type: 1
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Mr. Horse?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: His eyes open as well and he looks around the room. A big smile slowly
      creeps onto his face.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Oh my goodness!
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: What is it? Are you okay? What happened to you before we shifted?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Finally, he turns to me.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I am feeling great. You did it, {playerName}! I am home at last.
    alternativeText: I am feeling great. You did it! I am home at last.
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I take in my surroundings for the first time and notice where we landed.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Wow, we're in a very extravagant looking room. It does look like somewhere
      the royal family would live.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: We hear footsteps coming towards us, echoing from the hallway, and an appalled
      voice shouting.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: What is this ruckus all about?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e98f6dd1b5f6d3e4e87cd47b6a20f514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I can see Mr. Horse's eyes light up as he meets eyes with the tall figure
      entering the room.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 2
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Mom!
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: She lets out a loud gasp and runs towards us on sight. Her luscious mane
      swinging behind her.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "This must be the infamous queen of this kingdom then. She's beautiful.
      Her eyes remind me of Mr. Horse\u2026 The whole horsehead does, I suppose."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Prince! It is you!
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 61fc1d7aa81b44fd96274f46c48e8dfa, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I almost forgot that Prince is his real name. Maybe I should avoid calling
      him Mr. Horse around his mother.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: She wraps Mr. Horse in a big, long hug. When she steps back, her gaze shifts
      in my direction.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: And who might this be?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 61fc1d7aa81b44fd96274f46c48e8dfa, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "This is {playerName}. They're a friend from far away\u2026 It is a long
      story, We will explain later."
    alternativeText: "They're a friend from far away\u2026 It is a long story, We
      will explain later."
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I should greet her. How do you address a queen appropriately again? Mr.
      Horse told me once, but I can't really remember.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Your Majesty, it's a pleasure.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: She smirks.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: No need for all the formalities. You must be a very dear friend. Prince
      doesn't even allow me to hold his hand more than once in a while.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 61fc1d7aa81b44fd96274f46c48e8dfa, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I look down at my hand and notice it is indeed still interlinked with Mr.
      Horse's. We quickly let go and separate awkwardly.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: The queen lets out a small chuckle.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: In any way, you two must enlighten me about what has happened in the time
      since my dear Prince has left. Oh, I was deeply worried. I am so glad my baby
      is safe.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 61fc1d7aa81b44fd96274f46c48e8dfa, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: She nuzzles up to her son once more.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Mom\u2026 stop."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 2
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: We head to the great hall to sit down and talk about everything.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Mr. Horse begins with telling his mother about how he suddenly got transported
      into my dimension. He leaves out the details of where he first ended up, just
      like when he told me about his teleportation.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: He continues talking about his life in this foreign world and how he met
      me.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I chime in to explain the shift back to the kingdom, the weird experience
      in the white void, and finally, the unusual things Mr. Horse went through since
      then and how we ultimately ended up here once more.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Oh my\u2014"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 61fc1d7aa81b44fd96274f46c48e8dfa, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: She looks like she went through a whole rollercoaster of emotions hearing
      all of that. The expression she ends on is a concerned one, though.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: This is a lot of information for one sitting. She is probably a bit overwhelmed.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: She mutters a sentence to herself.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Aphilia's worries might have been justified after all.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 61fc1d7aa81b44fd96274f46c48e8dfa, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Who's Aphilia?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: First of all, it is an immense relief you two made it back here safely.
      {playerName}, you may stay here in our guest room until we have sorted things
      out, of course.
    alternativeText: First of all, it is an immense relief you two made it back here safely.
      And you may stay here in our guest room until we have sorted things
      out, of course.
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 61fc1d7aa81b44fd96274f46c48e8dfa, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "I can live in the royal palace? That is very nice of her. But what does
      she mean by \u2018sorting things out'?"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: We will arrange a meeting with Aphilia immediately. I advise you two speak
      with her, especially you, {playerName}.
    alternativeText: We will arrange a meeting with Aphilia immediately. I advise you two speak
      with her, especially you.
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 61fc1d7aa81b44fd96274f46c48e8dfa, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Mr. Horse tries to answer, but his mom doesn't seem to be finished yet
      and continues talking to me.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: And how are you feeling now? Have you noticed anything out of the ordinary
      since your return here?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 61fc1d7aa81b44fd96274f46c48e8dfa, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Have I? I was pretty occupied by being happy for Mr. Horse for the most
      part. But I did notice something.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d1cdacf9c9530b74b9973cee8a95af55, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 44fdf3762f1f4fd6a169b3992dc8da7f, type: 2}
